+## [v0.1.21-test.1] - 2026-11-25
+
+> R34 — runtime projection quality candidate; no physical receiver validation.
+> R34 动态投屏性能候选版，尚未实车验收。
+
+### English
+- Phase-aligned frame scheduling, source queue age expiry and IDR chain recovery.
+- Thermal and congestion-aware GPU pacing and encoder bitrate limits; gradual recovery.
+- Independent encoder lifecycle per configuration tier and blocked video socket watchdog.
+- Optional full-screen source content with aspect-fit input mapping.
+
+### 简体中文
+- 修复帧率节拍漂移、队列帧龄及关键帧恢复。
+- 温控、网络和 GPU 压力联动调节帧率及编码码率，条件恢复后分级提帧。
+- 编码器阶梯独立释放，视频数据口写停滞安全退出。
+- 新增可选全屏高清内容及一致触控映射。
+
 ## [v0.1.20-test.1] - 2026-11-25
 
 > R33 — negotiated 60 FPS candidate; real receiver and codec performance unverified.
 
+### English
 - Remove the experimental GM E2LB 30 FPS hard cap; honor valid receiver limits and saved preference.
 - Opt-in dashboard defaults to 60 FPS; unknown or malformed receiver capability falls back to 30 FPS.
 - Allow up to 15 Mbps at 60 FPS, keep existing ABR; retry local encoder initialization once at 30 FPS if high rate is rejected.
 - Display actual configured target separately from sent frame count; preferences take effect after reconnect.
+
+### 简体中文
 - 君越实验仪表盘优先协商 60 FPS，保留 30 FPS 回退；真实帧率仍需车机验证。
 
 ## [v0.1.19-test.1] - 2026-11-25
 
 > R32 — projection recovery candidate; not device validated.
 
+### English
 - Guard dashboard source geometry; stop stale-layout output and touch after a source size change.
 - Suppress dashboard on the next known-peer connection for ten minutes after a confirmed local pipeline fault; no persistent setting changes.
 - Honor MediaCodec BufferInfo offset and size; avoid starting dashboard GL while the phone does not own the screen.
+
+### 简体中文
 - 君越投屏故障降级、尺寸变化保护、编码缓冲区边界校验；尚待实车验证。
 
 ## [v0.1.18-test.1] - 2026-11-25
 
 > R31 — GM E2LB conservative projection candidate for the 2023 LaCrosse target. Not vehicle-validated.
 
+### English
 - Opt-in dashboard uses explicit receiver geometry, conservative 30 FPS maximum and up to 8 Mbps local encoding, no physical 6K assumption.
 - Adapt media panel to wide displays, retain aspect-fit content and matching touch mapping; unsupported geometry keeps compatibility mode.
+
+### 简体中文
 - 君越目标车型适配：仅在 E2LB 自报身份及有效显示能力、开启实验仪表盘时应用保守视频参数。原连接协议不改动，仍需实车验证。
 
